### Faculty Performance & Academic Activity Dashboard - REST Client Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login as Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@college.edu",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 3. Login as HoD
# @name hodLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hod.cse@college.edu",
  "password": "Hod@123"
}

### 4. Login as Faculty
# @name facultyLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "faculty1@college.edu",
  "password": "Faculty@123"
}

### 5. Get Current User Profile (with Cookie / Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 6. Get Academic Years
GET {{baseUrl}}/academic-years

### 7. Get Departments
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments

### 8. Get Scoring Configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoring-config

### 9. Get Teaching Records
GET {{baseUrl}}/teaching?page=1&limit=10

### 10. Get Publications Records
GET {{baseUrl}}/publications?page=1&limit=10

### 11. Get FDPs Records
GET {{baseUrl}}/fdps?page=1&limit=10

### 12. Get Consultancy Records
GET {{baseUrl}}/consultancy?page=1&limit=10

### 13. Get Patents Records
GET {{baseUrl}}/patents?page=1&limit=10
